# Northstar Consulting - Governance Standard

## Group creation
Only the lab administrator can create users, groups, Administrative Units, and applications.

## Global Administrator usage
The Global Administrator account is used only for tenant setup, emergency recovery, and tasks that require full tenant permissions.

## Daily work
After Day 5, normal daily work and testing will be done using a separate non-admin account.

## Data rule
This lab uses fictional users and fictional data only. No office tenant, company data, real passwords, or secrets will be used.

## Documentation rule
Every important configuration change will be documented and supported by a screenshot, export, or test result.
